@cortexkit/pi-magic-context 0.41.3
Source: https://github.com/cortexkit/magic-context (packages/pi-plugin)
Package metadata: license MIT, author "ualtinok".

The published npm package declares MIT but its `files` list contains only
`dist/` and `README.md`, so the tarball has no LICENSE file. This directory
ships the standard MIT text with a generic copyright-holder line rather than
inventing a year or name. If the upstream repository license becomes available,
replace LICENSE with that file verbatim.

Included files (3.26 MB total, 9 files):
  package.json                     upstream manifest (version/license/peer metadata)
  LICENSE                          MIT text
  NOTICE                           this file
  dist/index.js                    1,429 KB extension entry
  dist/index-s0zw9ddk.js           1,801 KB shared SQLite/schema/context core
  dist/index-147qn1yq.js              15 KB storage, logger, data paths
  dist/index-22jkk6wg.js             1.4 KB module resolution helper
  dist/index-b3eqj1g6.js             1.6 KB notification helper
  dist/fynvra-pi-tui-stub.js         1.3 KB Fynvra host stub

Why this cannot be reduced to only the compaction functions: `index.js` statically
imports the shared core (`index-s0zw9ddk.js`) for the SQLite schema, config
schema, compartment storage, tag/drop engine and historian prompts; that core is
a 1.8 MB bundled chunk. Splitting it would mean rewriting/vendoring the entire
Magic Context runtime, which this integration deliberately avoids. The omitted
chunks are the large optional features: `index-e7vx3byk.js` (2,420 KB quickjs),
`transformers*.js` (875-1,034 KB each, ONNX/embedding), plus subagent-entry.js,
historian-calibration-extension.js and OMP/OpenCode TUI helpers. Fynvra disables
embedding/dreamer/sidekick/smart-notes and runs the historian in-process, so those
modules are never imported.

Local patches (each marked with `Fynvra patch <n>` in the source):
   1. PiSubagentRunner.run delegates to the Fynvra in-process runner.
   2. loadPiConfig uses MAGIC_CONTEXT_CONFIG_ROOT instead of the session cwd.
   3. loadPiConfigDetailed uses MAGIC_CONTEXT_CONFIG_ROOT.
   4. configHome honors MAGIC_CONTEXT_CONFIG_HOME.
   5. ensureConfigLocationsMigrated is a no-op in the Fynvra host.
   6. historian response dumps go to MAGIC_CONTEXT_ARTIFACT_DIR.
   7. ensureCortexKitArtifactGitignore does not write into workspaces.
   8. @earendil-works/pi-tui imports (three sites) use the host stub.
   9. src_default reports its storage boot result to the Fynvra host.
  10. historian/dreamer/sidekick reduce nudges are disabled in the Fynvra host.
  11. session_before_compact only cancels native compaction after that session's
      runtime finished registering and session_start marked it ready; session_shutdown
      clears the mark. A partially initialized plugin therefore leaves native
      compaction in charge.

Do not edit these files by hand. Re-copy the upstream package and re-apply the
marked hunks when upgrading the pinned version.
